I want to flip light and darkness around, victorious return of the world.

01:21.520 --> 01:24.180
Hikari to kage tokkae WORLD he gaisen

01:24.380 --> 01:27.470
Now, the will to go towards the future and play on!

01:24.380 --> 01:27.470
Saa WILL TO GO mirai he to PLAY ON!

01:34.340 --> 01:40.390
I want to join the Bicycle Club.

01:41.300 --> 01:44.180
I want to bet my all on the bicycle.

01:45.060 --> 01:50.850
And, one day, when I can rely upon the bicycle to take down the world,

01:51.480 --> 01:53.360
Will you ride together with me?

01:57.110 --> 01:57.900
Together?

01:58.660 --> 02:02.200
Yes! Umm... Just a short distance apart.

02:02.430 --> 02:04.660
Fifty meters... Five meters...

02:05.120 --> 02:08.120
No, just this short a distance is enough.

02:08.540 --> 02:10.620
Is the "taking down the world" about becoming number one in the world?

02:12.380 --> 02:15.050
If you can, please wear a bathing suit.

02:29.520 --> 02:32.860
Eating this late at night will make you fatter and fatter.

02:33.310 --> 02:36.280
No problem. I'll diet on the side.

02:41.070 --> 02:42.450
Yousuke.

02:43.910 --> 02:45.780
I found a new member.

02:47.540 --> 02:49.450
Tomorrow, I'll bring him there.

02:51.120 --> 02:52.420
Please take care of the reward.

02:54.880 --> 02:55.920
Reward!

03:01.840 --> 03:02.760
Reward! Reward!

03:02.990 --> 03:04.120
Reward! Reward!

03:16.520 --> 03:20.240
Umm... May I use Dad's hair oil?

03:20.490 --> 03:24.160
I don't mind.

03:24.950 --> 03:27.330
May I use Mom's perfume?

03:27.830 --> 03:30.450
Remember to put it back in its original place.

03:31.080 --> 03:35.000
Eri, hurry and tell me what the latest popular accessories are.

03:35.630 --> 03:37.920
Sure, I'll tell you later.

03:38.460 --> 03:44.430
Umm... okay. Oh, that's right. It'll be fine.

03:49.680 --> 03:53.100
Hair oil? Perfume? Popular?

03:59.570 --> 04:00.150
Okay.

04:03.610 --> 04:04.200
Okay.

04:08.160 --> 04:08.830
‌Okay.

04:12.250 --> 04:12.910
Okay.

04:13.830 --> 04:15.210
Okay!

04:22.170 --> 04:24.300
Today, I'll arrive late again.

04:30.220 --> 04:35.690
Now, let's proceed on the next page with the explanation on equations with two unknown variables.

04:36.150 --> 04:45.700
Example problems two and three.

04:45.840 --> 04:46.700
That's cute.

04:46.860 --> 04:48.120
I wear it everywhere..

04:50.450 --> 04:52.080
This problem...

04:53.160 --> 04:55.500
Sorry. I'm late.

04:57.580 --> 04:58.920
Everyone's staring at me.

04:59.420 --> 05:01.630
Fukazawa-san, you again?

05:02.340 --> 05:04.550
Ever since the start of school, you've always been late.

05:05.170 --> 05:06.880
I can't get out of bed in the morning,

05:07.260 --> 05:08.260
and I have low blood pressure.

05:08.890 --> 05:11.680
At least next time, remember to come in through the back door.

05:12.390 --> 05:14.850
Okay. I'll be careful next time.

05:24.490 --> 05:27.860
Wh-What's with that outrageous hairstyle?

05:28.990 --> 05:30.990
Huh? Not good?

05:32.160 --> 05:35.160
I thought you might like this hairstyle more.

05:35.710 --> 05:36.910
Who would like it?

05:37.540 --> 05:40.630
It stinks! What's up with the heavy sweet smell?

05:40.840 --> 05:43.250
I used my mom's perfume.

05:43.500 --> 05:47.220
Why? Why would you do that?

05:48.550 --> 05:57.310
Is Fukazawa-san talking with Shinozaki? Why? When did they become so close? But still, Fukazawa-san sure is cute.

05:59.850 --> 06:02.060
Is it too mature?

06:05.860 --> 06:10.700
Really. What kind of influence did that type of weird hairstyle get?

06:12.700 --> 06:14.370
It changed again!

06:17.620 --> 06:19.080
Is this not good either?

06:20.380 --> 06:23.460
Is it because it has too much of a celebrity feeling?

06:25.090 --> 06:26.250
How irritating.

06:35.260 --> 06:37.270
Is that weird person beside you

06:37.430 --> 06:39.980
the one that was riding the bicycle yesterday?

06:40.600 --> 06:41.600
Is it?

06:41.810 --> 06:43.190
Do you know him?

06:44.650 --> 06:47.570
Not really.

06:47.940 --> 06:51.530
It's better not to bring up an old friendship.

06:51.700 --> 06:52.530
Not good.

06:53.240 --> 06:55.870
How could that be?

07:07.170 --> 07:08.090
Sorry!

07:09.630 --> 07:10.470
Go ahead.

07:11.340 --> 07:12.090
No.

07:12.300 --> 07:13.720
Ummm...

07:15.100 --> 07:15.930
Go ahead.

07:16.970 --> 07:19.310
Thank you. Sorry.

07:24.900 --> 07:26.020
I can't! I can't!

07:26.400 --> 07:28.190
I already have Fukazawa-san.

07:28.480 --> 07:29.570
‌I can't

07:34.200 --> 07:36.160
Vulgar. Disgusting.

07:36.660 --> 07:38.240
He really is weird.

08:22.410 --> 08:23.290
Let's go, Yuki.

08:24.620 --> 08:25.370
What about Youko?

08:25.710 --> 08:27.210
She said she's going out with a guy today.

08:27.750 --> 08:28.630
Really?

08:28.710 --> 08:29.630
That sloppy guy?

08:29.960 --> 08:31.550
You'll make her cry if you say that.

08:32.220 --> 08:33.510
I'll let it go this time then.

08:38.930 --> 08:39.890
Fukazawa-san.

08:41.140 --> 08:42.470
What about the Bicycle Club?

09:01.910 --> 09:03.250
You really make people angry.

09:04.290 --> 09:06.410
Fukazawa-san!

09:07.120 --> 09:10.670
Hey... Can't you walk faster?

09:10.750 --> 09:12.500
I am walking.

09:12.960 --> 09:14.340
Then let's go.

09:14.720 --> 09:19.550
Umm... What are you doing here?

09:25.390 --> 09:26.690
I'm going back.

09:27.440 --> 09:29.150
No, no, no...

09:29.520 --> 09:31.310
Didn't you want to go to the Bicycle Club?

09:31.610 --> 09:35.530
I'll walk! I'll walk!

09:56.470 --> 09:58.550
How many times are you going to swallow until you're satisfied?

09:59.550 --> 10:03.930
What a pain. Hurry up and open the door. Go.

10:05.680 --> 10:06.850
I... I have to open it?

10:07.180 --> 10:09.390
Open it. Open it.

10:09.520 --> 10:10.150
Okay.

10:13.610 --> 10:15.650
If I open this door,

10:16.610 --> 10:19.820
the bright future between Fukazawa-san and me...

10:25.870 --> 10:28.370
There's another door inside the door?

10:28.620 --> 10:29.710
Hurry and open it!

10:30.040 --> 10:30.670
Okay.

10:42.390 --> 10:43.680
It's all dark.

10:44.760 --> 10:47.680
Is our future also dark?

10:47.770 --> 10:49.180
Yuki-chan.

10:51.310 --> 10:52.600
I caught you.

10:55.650 --> 10:58.400
What is this person doing?

11:03.950 --> 11:06.580
Really. Stupid Yousuke.

11:07.750 --> 11:09.450
What are you looking at?

11:09.500 --> 11:11.750
Nowhere. Umm... I'm sorry.

11:13.420 --> 11:15.590
I... I saw an incredible scene.

11:19.760 --> 11:24.260
I-If this continues for two or three weeks, will the situation turn worse?

11:25.640 --> 11:26.470
Yousuke?

11:27.810 --> 11:31.480
Too small, too small.

11:31.890 --> 11:38.070
Getting angry over something this small,

11:40.700 --> 11:44.610
Could this person be Fukazawa-san's older brother?

11:45.200 --> 11:48.120
Are you the new member Yuki talked about?

11:49.500 --> 11:52.580
Yuki's always been good at catching big fish since she was little.

11:55.540 --> 11:58.630
One look can tell you that he's the real deal.

12:00.300 --> 12:04.260
He's bleeding too heavily, but that's also evidence that he's the real deal.

12:05.640 --> 12:09.390
I'm Fukazawa Yousuke, Yuki's older brother.

12:09.970 --> 12:10.970
Nice to meet you.

12:11.560 --> 12:15.270
I'm Shinozaki. This is...

12:16.360 --> 12:20.280
Our club basically welcomes children filled with wit.

12:20.780 --> 12:21.690
So...

12:24.490 --> 12:28.530
Nothing, nothing. This is only a simple test.

12:29.870 --> 12:32.080
Let's see you bury your face for three minutes.

12:32.710 --> 12:34.250
Th-Three minutes?

12:36.170 --> 12:39.880
No, but I don't know how to swim.

12:51.930 --> 12:53.600
Don't worry! Don't worry!

12:53.640 --> 12:56.690
Even though Yuki's breasts are small, she has a good eye for people.

12:57.400 --> 12:59.560
I'm really begging you to go die.

13:00.690 --> 13:03.820
Then practice until tomorrow. Remember to report back to me.

13:05.150 --> 13:06.530
He didn't bleed enough.

13:07.320 --> 13:08.320
What a weird person.

13:09.030 --> 13:10.410
Then let's go.

13:11.040 --> 13:13.910
Anyway, according to my record there's no harm in lies.

13:19.040 --> 13:19.920
Are you really doing it?!

13:38.190 --> 13:40.060
Interesting.

13:44.490 --> 13:46.950
There's no way he can last three minutes.

13:48.240 --> 13:49.740
He's not a fish.

13:55.960 --> 13:57.410
Why did you drink the water?

13:58.290 --> 14:00.630
Oh, no! I unconsciously drank it!

14:01.590 --> 14:02.420
Unconsciously?

14:08.260 --> 14:14.220
Hey,actually, Yousuke doesn't really plan on letting you join.

14:14.770 --> 14:21.940
It's impossible for a person who hasn't received training to last for three minutes.

14:22.650 --> 14:26.440
Yeah. I also thought it might be like this.

14:27.530 --> 14:29.110
The water's spilling.

14:30.910 --> 14:33.830
If that's the case, then why are you still trying so hard?

14:35.200 --> 14:36.540
Why? I was just thinking about this question,

14:37.160 --> 14:41.540
but I still don't know.

14:43.090 --> 14:43.590
Only... Every time I try,

14:44.920 --> 14:48.010
‌I would drink up all the water.

14:48.220 --> 14:50.380
Now my stomach is full.

14:50.680 --> 14:53.010
I just said there's no such rule.

14:54.720 --> 14:56.680
Nose! Water entered my nose!

14:56.720 --> 14:58.180
Have you always been like this all your life?

15:07.530 --> 15:08.190
Why?

15:09.450 --> 15:12.320
Why am I doing this?

15:14.780 --> 15:17.490
It's dark and painful. But...

15:18.620 --> 15:22.540
The world I live in also has this feeling.

15:24.210 --> 15:27.750
At the heart of Fukazawa-san's world.

15:34.600 --> 15:36.890
Is that so? That's right.

15:40.430 --> 15:42.980
I want to change.

15:43.650 --> 15:45.190
I can't go on and not change.

16:08.500 --> 16:12.090
In the end, I still can't change anything.

16:33.030 --> 16:33.610
Are you dead?

16:34.780 --> 16:35.820
I-I'm still alive.

16:37.120 --> 16:40.540
Umm... I was just thinking that you might have gone home already.

16:44.040 --> 16:45.620
If you're going to drink anyway,

16:46.040 --> 16:47.710
‌‌then you might as well drink some juice.

16:49.800 --> 16:50.710
Fukazawa-san.

16:57.390 --> 16:58.010
Do you want to ride together?

17:04.440 --> 17:06.940
Thank you! Please!

17:24.040 --> 17:26.410
It's true that this is riding together, but...

17:27.170 --> 17:28.750
Did you say something?

17:29.290 --> 17:29.880
No.

17:30.380 --> 17:32.750
What a nice wind.

17:38.180 --> 17:41.600
Umm... The night bike path is over there.

17:42.140 --> 17:43.350
It's okay. It's okay.

17:43.720 --> 17:45.850
‌This way is the best.

17:51.440 --> 17:54.570
Fukazawa-san has a very mature smell on her.

17:55.320 --> 17:56.110
Let's go!

18:09.830 --> 18:11.290
Fuka-Fukazawa-san!

18:11.670 --> 18:12.630
It's too fast!

18:12.960 --> 18:15.880
S-Slow down a bit!

18:16.380 --> 18:17.630
Look, Shinozaki.

18:24.640 --> 18:26.390
It's awesome, right?

18:27.180 --> 18:28.890
Because you need light when you're riding at night,

18:29.060 --> 18:31.940
but the light is too bright so you can't see other pretty things.

18:32.730 --> 18:37.570
Don't you think it's stupid? I would occasionally come here, like when I'm feeling like this or down

18:37.780 --> 18:40.450
Then after looking at this scenery, my mood would change.

18:39.950 --> 18:40.450
‌‌ ‌‌

18:46.250 --> 18:47.540
It feels incredible.

18:49.620 --> 18:53.540
Just by changing an angle, the world's colors can be completely different.

18:58.090 --> 18:59.260
As long as I'm willing,

19:00.680 --> 19:02.430
will my world also expand limitlessly?

19:04.050 --> 19:05.510
Hey, Shinozaki.

19:07.600 --> 19:08.220
I broke it.

19:09.940 --> 19:11.560
What did you say?!

19:21.410 --> 19:22.200
Safe.

19:23.200 --> 19:25.320
I... I don't know how to swim.

19:25.620 --> 19:30.410
Just a little bit more and it would've been dangerous. Right, Fukazawa-san?

19:33.000 --> 19:34.080
Fukazawa-san?

19:52.480 --> 19:55.270
Fukazawa-san, I've made up my mind.

19:56.820 --> 19:58.980
I'll definitely join the Bicycle Club.

20:00.030 --> 20:01.110
I'll work hard.

20:01.950 --> 20:03.740
I'll work as hard as I can.

20:04.870 --> 20:07.070
I will definitely rely on the bicycle to conquer the world.

20:08.160 --> 20:09.330
And, one day,

20:10.290 --> 20:12.910
‌I will change your heart, Fukazawa-san.

20:15.420 --> 20:17.000
Did you know, Shinozaki?

20:18.170 --> 20:20.920
Doing that won't make me say you're cool.

20:21.470 --> 20:24.970
So weak. It makes me angry.

20:26.510 --> 20:26.970
So annoying. But...

20:32.430 --> 20:35.810
This must be courage.

20:38.940 --> 20:40.940
It's painful. I'm scared.

20:41.360 --> 20:43.780
Breathe... I want to breathe.

20:44.860 --> 20:45.860
I can't anymore.

20:46.240 --> 20:47.620
‌I might die like this...

20:49.970 --> 20:50.720
No.

20:51.770 --> 20:52.520
‌‌No!

20:53.890 --> 20:54.640
I...

20:55.940 --> 20:57.650
I've decided!

21:03.530 --> 21:04.450
Four minutes.

21:12.160 --> 21:13.040
Thank goodness.

21:13.620 --> 21:16.920
Just halfway through, it became so painful that I almost died, but thank goodness I didn't give up.

21:18.830 --> 21:21.130
As long as it's possible, I can do it too.

21:22.300 --> 21:25.970
Back then, it was you who was drowning and I saved you.

21:31.510 --> 21:32.430
Interesting.

21:36.890 --> 21:40.480
But to hold out for four minutes, how did you do it?

21:41.690 --> 21:47.150
It's nothing.

21:47.820 --> 21:50.160
See, because it's harder to drink soda.

21:51.950 --> 21:53.160
Carbonated?

